{"seq":2,"slug":"nutrition-recovery","title":"高一体育与健康 — 营养与恢复","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/year-1/sports-health/sports-science/nutrition-recovery","wordCount":2484,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"高一体育与健康-营养与恢复\">高一体育与健康 — 营养与恢复</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>训练是对身体的&quot;破坏&quot;，恢复才是真正的&quot;建设&quot;。肌肉在训练中被微损伤，在休息和营养补充中修复、增强。如果只练不恢复，身体会陷入疲劳积累→免疫力下降→伤病增多的恶性循环。因此，营养和恢复与训练同等重要，是运动能力持续提升的三根支柱。</p>\n<p>运动营养的三大宏量营养素：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>营养素</th>\n<th>主要功能</th>\n<th>占每日能量比例</th>\n<th>最佳食物来源</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>碳水化合物</td>\n<td>运动的首要能源</td>\n<td>50%-60%</td>\n<td>米饭、面条、红薯、水果</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>蛋白质</td>\n<td>修复和构建肌肉</td>\n<td>15%-20%</td>\n<td>鸡蛋、鱼肉、牛奶、豆腐</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>脂肪</td>\n<td>长时间运动的能源储备</td>\n<td>20%-30%</td>\n<td>坚果、鱼油、橄榄油</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>与久坐人群相比，经常运动的高中生需要更多的碳水化合物来补充肌糖原储备，以及更多的蛋白质来支持肌肉修复。但&quot;更多&quot;不等于&quot;越多越好&quot;——过量摄入任何营养素都可能适得其反。</p>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"一-碳水化合物-运动的燃料\">一、碳水化合物——运动的燃料</h3><p>碳水化合物在体内以糖原形式储存在肌肉和肝脏中。肌糖原是中高强度运动的首选燃料，储量约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>300</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">300</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">300</span></span></span></span></span>-<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>400</mn><mi>g</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">400g</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">400</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span>（对应 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1200</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1200</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1200</span></span></span></span></span>-<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1600</mn><mtext> </mtext><mi>k</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1600\\ kcal</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1600</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span> 的能量）。</p>\n<p><strong>碳水化合物的类型</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>消化速度</th>\n<th>升血糖速度</th>\n<th>代表食物</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>简单碳水</td>\n<td>快</td>\n<td>快（高 GI）</td>\n<td>白糖、蜂蜜、白面包</td>\n<td>运动中/后快速补能</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>复杂碳水</td>\n<td>慢</td>\n<td>慢（低 GI）</td>\n<td>糙米、燕麦、红薯</td>\n<td>日常饮食、赛前</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>运动前</strong>：赛前 2-3 小时吃一顿以复杂碳水为主的餐食（如米饭 + 蔬菜 + 少量蛋白质）。赛前 30 分钟可以吃少量简单碳水（如香蕉、能量棒）。</p>\n<p><strong>运动中</strong>：运动时间超过 60 分钟的持续性运动，每小时补充 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>30</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">30</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">30</span></span></span></span></span>-<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>60</mn><mi>g</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">60g</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">60</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span> 碳水化合物（如运动饮料、能量胶）。短时间运动不需要补充。</p>\n<p><strong>运动后</strong>：在运动结束后 30 分钟内（&quot;营养窗口期&quot;）摄入碳水化合物，此时肌糖原合成速率最高。理想比例为碳水：蛋白质 = 3:1 到 4:1（如一杯巧克力牛奶）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"二-蛋白质-肌肉的建筑材料\">二、蛋白质——肌肉的建筑材料</h3><p>蛋白质由氨基酸组成。人体需要 20 种氨基酸，其中 9 种&quot;必需氨基酸&quot;无法自身合成，必须从食物中获取。</p>\n<p><strong>运动人群的蛋白质需求</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>人群</th>\n<th>每日需求量</th>\n<th>实际举例（60kg 体重）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>普通人</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.8</mn><mtext> </mtext><mi>g</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>k</mi><mi>g</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.8\\ g/kg</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.8</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>48</mn><mi>g</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">48g</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">48</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>耐力运动者</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1.2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1.2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.2</span></span></span></span></span>-<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1.4</mn><mtext> </mtext><mi>g</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>k</mi><mi>g</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1.4\\ g/kg</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.4</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>72</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">72</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">72</span></span></span></span></span>-<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>84</mn><mi>g</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">84g</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">84</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>力量训练者</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1.6</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1.6</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.6</span></span></span></span></span>-<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2.0</mn><mtext> </mtext><mi>g</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>k</mi><mi>g</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2.0\\ g/kg</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2.0</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>96</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">96</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">96</span></span></span></span></span>-<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>120</mn><mi>g</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">120g</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">120</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>一个鸡蛋约含 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>7</mn><mi>g</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">7g</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">7</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span> 蛋白质，一杯 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>250</mn><mi>m</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">250ml</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">250</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span> 牛奶约含 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>8</mn><mi>g</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">8g</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span>，100g 鸡胸肉约含 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>25</mn><mi>g</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">25g</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">25</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<p><strong>蛋白质摄入时机</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>每餐均匀分配（每餐 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>20</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">20</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20</span></span></span></span></span>-<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>30</mn><mi>g</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">30g</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">30</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span>），而非集中在一餐中大量摄入</li>\n<li>运动后 30-60 分钟内摄入 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>20</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">20</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20</span></span></span></span></span>-<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>25</mn><mi>g</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">25g</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">25</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span> 优质蛋白质，促进肌肉修复</li>\n<li>睡前少量酪蛋白（如一杯牛奶或酸奶）有助于夜间肌肉恢复</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>不需要蛋白粉吗？</strong></p>\n<p>对于饮食正常的高中生，完全可以通过日常饮食获得足够的蛋白质。蛋白粉只是&quot;方便食品&quot;，不具备食物中的维生素、矿物质和膳食纤维等营养成分。</p>\n<h3 id=\"三-水与电解质\">三、水与电解质</h3><p>水是最容易被忽视的&quot;营养素&quot;。人体约 60% 由水组成，运动中通过出汗可能每小时损失 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.5</span></span></span></span></span>-<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span> 的水分。</p>\n<p><strong>汗液的成分</strong>：</p>\n<p>汗液不只是水，还含有钠（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><msup><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Na^+</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）、钾（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>K</mi><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K^+</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）、氯（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><msup><mi>l</mi><mo>−</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Cl^-</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）等电解质。大量出汗后只补水不补电解质会导致血液中钠浓度过低（低钠血症），严重时可能危及生命。</p>\n<p><strong>判断脱水的简便方法——尿液颜色</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>尿液颜色</th>\n<th>水分状态</th>\n<th>行动</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>淡黄色/几乎透明</td>\n<td>充分水合</td>\n<td>正常</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>中等黄色</td>\n<td>轻度脱水</td>\n<td>增加饮水</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>深黄色/琥珀色</td>\n<td>明显脱水</td>\n<td>立即补充水分</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>运动饮料 vs 纯水</strong>：</p>\n<p>运动时间 &lt; 60 分钟且强度中等：纯水即可\n运动时间 &gt; 60 分钟或大量出汗：含 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span></span></span></span></span>-<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>8</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">8\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8%</span></span></span></span></span> 碳水化合物和电解质的运动饮料更佳</p>\n<p>自制运动饮料配方：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span> 水 + <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>40</mn><mi>g</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">40g</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">40</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span> 白糖 + <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>g</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3g</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span> 盐 + 少量柠檬汁调味</p>\n<h3 id=\"四-恢复策略\">四、恢复策略</h3><p><strong>睡眠——最强大的恢复工具</strong></p>\n<p>生长激素（促进肌肉修复和生长）主要在深度睡眠期间分泌。高中生每晚需要 8-10 小时的睡眠。</p>\n<p>促进高质量睡眠的习惯：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>固定作息时间（每天同一时间上床和起床）</li>\n<li>睡前 1 小时减少屏幕使用（蓝光抑制褪黑素分泌）</li>\n<li>卧室保持凉爽（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>18</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">18</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">18</span></span></span></span></span>-<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>22</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">22°C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">22°</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span>）和黑暗</li>\n<li>避免临睡前剧烈运动（训练应在睡前 3 小时以上完成）</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>主动恢复</strong></p>\n<p>完全静卧并不是最佳恢复方式。低强度的活动（如散步、慢骑、轻度拉伸）能促进血液循环，加速乳酸清除和营养物质运输。</p>\n<p><strong>恢复方法对比</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>恢复方法</th>\n<th>作用机制</th>\n<th>时机</th>\n<th>推荐程度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>充足睡眠</td>\n<td>激素分泌、神经修复</td>\n<td>每天</td>\n<td>必须</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>营养补充</td>\n<td>能量恢复、肌肉修复</td>\n<td>运动后 30 分钟内</td>\n<td>必须</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>静态拉伸</td>\n<td>缓解肌肉紧张</td>\n<td>运动后</td>\n<td>推荐</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>冷水浴/冰敷</td>\n<td>减少炎症反应</td>\n<td>高强度训练后</td>\n<td>适度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>泡沫滚轴</td>\n<td>筋膜释放</td>\n<td>训练后/休息日</td>\n<td>推荐</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>按摩</td>\n<td>促进血液循环</td>\n<td>休息日</td>\n<td>如条件允许</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"五-高中生常见营养误区\">五、高中生常见营养误区</h3><p><strong>误区一：&quot;运动后不能吃东西，否则白练了&quot;</strong></p>\n<p>事实：运动后进食不但不会&quot;白练&quot;，反而是肌肉恢复的关键时机。运动后 30 分钟内补充碳水和蛋白质，肌糖原合成速率比延迟进食高 2-3 倍。</p>\n<p><strong>误区二：&quot;减肥就是不吃主食&quot;</strong></p>\n<p>事实：碳水化合物是大脑唯一的直接能源。不吃主食会导致血糖下降、注意力降低、运动时无力。合理减脂应该是适量减少总热量摄入（减少 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>300</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">300</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">300</span></span></span></span></span>-<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>500</mn><mtext> </mtext><mi>k</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">500\\ kcal</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">500</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span>/天），而不是完全戒断某类营养素。</p>\n<p><strong>误区三：&quot;喝水太多会水中毒&quot;</strong></p>\n<p>事实：正常饮水不会中毒。&quot;水中毒&quot;（低钠血症）发生在极端情况下——如马拉松中短时间内饮入大量纯水而不补充电解质。日常训练中只要正常饮水、适时补充电解质就不会出现这个问题。</p>\n<p><strong>误区四：&quot;运动越累效果越好&quot;</strong></p>\n<p>事实：效果取决于训练 + 恢复的综合效果。过度训练不但不会提升成绩，还会导致免疫力下降、情绪低落、运动损伤，这种状态称为&quot;过度训练综合征&quot;。</p>\n<h3 id=\"六-过度训练的识别与预防\">六、过度训练的识别与预防</h3><p>过度训练综合征的警示信号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>持续性疲劳，休息后不缓解</li>\n<li>运动成绩停滞或下降</li>\n<li>安静心率比平时高 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span></span></span></span></span>-<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span></span></span></span></span> 次/分钟</li>\n<li>睡眠质量变差</li>\n<li>食欲下降</li>\n<li>频繁感冒或小伤不愈</li>\n<li>情绪烦躁或抑郁</li>\n</ul>\n<p>预防原则：&quot;训练三天休一天&quot;，每周安排 1-2 个完全休息日或主动恢复日。训练量增加不超过每周 10%。</p>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li><p>记录你某一天的饮食内容，估算碳水化合物、蛋白质和脂肪的大致摄入量。与推荐比例对比，你的饮食结构合理吗？需要做哪些调整？</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>设计一个&quot;运动后恢复餐&quot;食谱，要求满足：碳水约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>60</mn><mi>g</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">60g</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">60</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span>、蛋白质约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>20</mn><mi>g</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">20g</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span>、容易准备、味道可口。使用常见的食物。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>计算你在一节体育课中大约流失多少水分（课前课后各称一次体重，减少的体重克数约等于失水毫升数）。据此制定该课的补水计划。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>某同学为了&quot;快速增肌&quot;，每天吃 5 个鸡蛋、喝 3 杯蛋白粉，但运动成绩并没有明显提升。分析可能的原因，并给出合理的营养建议。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>比较以下两种恢复方案的效果：(a) 训练后什么都不做直接回教室；(b) 训练后 10 分钟拉伸 + 一根香蕉 + 一盒牛奶 + 晚上提前 30 分钟睡觉。从生理学角度解释为什么方案 (b) 更好。</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><p>运动营养学是一个快速发展的研究领域。近年来，时间营养学（Chrono-nutrition）的概念引起广泛关注——不仅要关注&quot;吃什么&quot;和&quot;吃多少&quot;，还要关注&quot;什么时候吃&quot;。研究发现，在身体生物钟的特定时段进食，营养素的吸收和利用效率有显著差异。</p>\n<p>推荐了解的方向：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>运动员的赛前营养策略</strong>：马拉松选手赛前 3 天的&quot;糖原超量恢复法&quot;（碳水负荷法）可以使肌糖原储量增加 50%-100%</li>\n<li><strong>益生菌与运动恢复</strong>：肠道健康影响营养吸收和免疫功能，部分研究显示特定益生菌菌株能减少运动后的上呼吸道感染</li>\n<li><strong>冷热交替浴</strong>：交替使用冷水和热水浸泡，可能通过血管收缩和舒张的&quot;泵效应&quot;促进恢复</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>营养和恢复是运动训练不可分割的组成部分。碳水化合物提供运动能源，蛋白质修复和构建肌肉，充分的水分和电解质维持身体正常功能。睡眠是最重要的恢复手段，运动后的营养窗口期（30 分钟内）是补充能量和蛋白质的黄金时机。避免过度训练，学会识别身体的疲劳信号，才能在训练与恢复之间保持健康的平衡。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"高一体育与健康 — 营养与恢复","id":"高一体育与健康-营养与恢复"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"一、碳水化合物——运动的燃料","id":"一-碳水化合物-运动的燃料"},{"level":3,"text":"二、蛋白质——肌肉的建筑材料","id":"二-蛋白质-肌肉的建筑材料"},{"level":3,"text":"三、水与电解质","id":"三-水与电解质"},{"level":3,"text":"四、恢复策略","id":"四-恢复策略"},{"level":3,"text":"五、高中生常见营养误区","id":"五-高中生常见营养误区"},{"level":3,"text":"六、过度训练的识别与预防","id":"六-过度训练的识别与预防"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"高一体育与健康 — 运动生理","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/year-1/sports-health/sports-science/exercise-physiology"},"next":{"title":"高一体育与健康 — 运动损伤","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/year-1/sports-health/sports-science/sports-injury"}}